空灵的“发光感”（Glow），背部和后脑自然隐入黑暗，明暗衰减过渡平滑。\n\n**6. 渲染/视觉风格**\n高端美妆/时尚人像摄影。带有强烈的空灵、清冷氛围，局部柔焦处理，类似CG级别的精细修图质感。\n\n---\n\n### AI 绘图提示词 (Prompt)\n\n> **A high-end fashion portrait of a beautiful young Asian woman looking over her shoulder, sharp jawline, loose hair strands gracefully falling across her face. She has pale porcelain skin, subtle light pink lips, wearing a minimal grey fine-knit top, a pearl earring, and a metal helix piercing. Pure black minimalist background. Soft diffused studio lighting, high-key illumination on the face fading dramatically into deep shadows. Ethereal aesthetic, soft focus, pale and cool color palette, highly detailed beauty photography, 8k resolution, photorealistic. --ar 1:1 --style raw --v 6.0**"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [578.3809204101562, 193.92947387695312], "pos": [687.3668823242188, 1010.6715698242188], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-523.9934379947364, -400.9238623255329], "scale": 0.7513148009015778}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "视觉分析", "bounding": [628.7716674804688, -606.0653686523438, 1959.5833740234375, 780.4110107421875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "复刻图片", "bounding": [619.6328735351562, 487.5782775878906, 2277.78759765625, 830.941162109375]}], "links": [[7, 13, 0, 10, 0, "STRING"], [8, 13, 0, 12, 0, "*"], [11, 14, 0, 13, 0, "IMAGE"], [12, 11, 0, 13, 11, "STRING"], [15, 16, 0, 17, 0, "IMAGE"], [16, 16, 0, 18, 0, "IMAGE"], [18, 15, 0, 16, 1, "IMAGE"], [25, 22, 0, 16, 0, "IMAGE"], [27, 19, 0, 16, 11, "STRING"]], "id": "2e8da2c6-435d-4307-9649-6c44ddca1cc2", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "la